      "appliesToClassifications": ["CENTRAL_MERIT", "PHILANTHROPIC_STACKABLE"],
      "guidanceMessage": "These scholarships can be legally combined. Reliance Foundation allows government aid up to the total institutional cost of education."
    },
    {
      "code": "RULE_PHILANTHROPIC_WELFARE_STACKING",
